OL,3,GNEWSAHeavily pregnant woman dies in
OL,4,Atwo-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 30s who was heavily
OL,7,Fpregnant has died following a crash
OL,8,Finvolving two vehicles in Wiltshire.
OL,10,FWiltshire Police said emergency
OL,11,Fservices were called to the collision
OL,12,Finvolving a Toyota Aygo and a
OL,13,FVolkswagen Polo on Countess Road, in
OL,14,FAmesbury, at about 20:00 GMT on
OL,15,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
