OL,3,GNEWSAHeavily pregnant woman dies in
OL,4,Atwo-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the Toyota - a man in his
OL,7,F30s - sustained minor injuries but a
OL,8,Fwoman travelling in the same vehicle
OL,9,Fdied at the scene. Police said her
OL,10,Ffamily had been informed and were being
OL,11,Fsupported by specialist trained
OL,12,Fofficers.
OL,14,FOfficers said the occupants of the
OL,15,Fsecond vehicle were not injured in the
OL,16,Fcrash.
